    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.11_base_commutative_diagram.chapters.11_proof_transcripts.sections.02_full_proof_transcript_cocone_universal.concrete_anchor_9_microchipidentifies#microchip_identifies" .
silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_11_proof_transcripts_sections_02_full_proof_transcript_cocone_universal_concrete_anchor_9_microchipidentifies#microchip_identifies silm:hasLongDescription "The microchip_identifies is the microchip-reader typed arrow identifying Mittens by id, NOT replacing the apex. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'microchip_identifies', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
